{
  "case": "due2-grant-signers",
  "source": "due2-native (closes corpus coverage gaps: grant scope, discharges, the duty's attester)",
  "classification": "odrl-profile",
  "needs": [
    "due2:instanceScope",
    "due2:attestingParty"
  ],
  "notes": "Authored for due2; no origin result. The case format spells the grant that evidence.discharges names as {\"duty\": <source duty>, \"reference\": <request reference>} — the inputs of the digest workflows §5.3 defines — so cases stay hand-writable; the evaluator computes the digest. ex:Bank attests ex:payPerUse through due2:attestingParty, a party function (due2-profiles.md §6), so evidence counts for the duty only if its issuer is ex:Bank or a party below it. Since the duty declares a function, it inherits no party from ex:download (ODRL IM §2.6.5) and states its assignee, ex:Alice. The case keeps the name it had when the attesting parties were a configuration record, the signers.",
  "prefixes": {
    "ex": "https://example.org/"
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "payment discharges this download",
      "request": {
        "reference": "req-7",
        "action": "ex:downloadReport",
        "target": "ex:MarketReport",
        "at": "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z",
        "parties": {
          "odrl:assignee": "ex:Alice"
        },
        "params": {}
      },
      "sotw": {
        "effective_at": "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z",
        "facts": {},
        "evidence": [
          {
            "id": "ev-pay",
            "occurred_at": "2026-06-01T11:58:00Z",
            "actor": "ex:Alice",
            "action": "ex:pay",
            "object": "ex:ReportFee",
            "issuer": "ex:Bank",
            "discharges": {
              "duty": "ex:payPerUse",
              "reference": "req-7"
            }
          }
        ],
        "activation": {},
        "closure": []
      },
      "expected": {
        "verdict": "Permit",
        "frontier": [],
        "obligations": [],
        "why": "ex:payPerUse is grant-scoped, so its instance is req-7's, and only evidence that discharges (payPerUse, req-7) can witness it. ev-pay is a pay on ex:ReportFee by the bearer (Alice, the duty's assignee), before effective_at, issued by ex:Bank, the duty's attester, and it discharges exactly that grant: a witness. The candidate is ready."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "the same payment, a second download",
      "request": {
        "reference": "req-8",
        "action": "ex:downloadReport",
        "target": "ex:MarketReport",
        "at": "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z",
        "parties": {
          "odrl:assignee": "ex:Alice"
        },
        "params": {}
      },
      "sotw": {
        "effective_at": "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z",
        "facts": {},
        "evidence": [
          {
            "id": "ev-pay",
            "occurred_at": "2026-06-01T11:58:00Z",
            "actor": "ex:Alice",
            "action": "ex:pay",
            "object": "ex:ReportFee",
            "issuer": "ex:Bank",
            "discharges": {
              "duty": "ex:payPerUse",
              "reference": "req-7"
            }
          }
        ],
        "activation": {},
        "closure": []
      },
      "expected": {
        "verdict": "Pending",
        "frontier": [
          [
            "ex:payPerUse"
          ]
        ],
        "obligations": [],
        "why": "The instance is now req-8's. ev-pay discharges req-7's grant, so under grant scope it is no witness here (§5.3): the duty is F, outstanding, and the one route is to pay again."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "self-attested payment",
      "request": {
        "reference": "req-7",
        "action": "ex:downloadReport",
        "target": "ex:MarketReport",
        "at": "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z",
        "parties": {
          "odrl:assignee": "ex:Alice"
        },
        "params": {}
      },
      "sotw": {
        "effective_at": "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z",
        "facts": {},
        "evidence": [
          {
            "id": "ev-pay",
            "occurred_at": "2026-06-01T11:58:00Z",
            "actor": "ex:Alice",
            "action": "ex:pay",
            "object": "ex:ReportFee",
            "issuer": "ex:Alice",
            "discharges": {
              "duty": "ex:payPerUse",
              "reference": "req-7"
            }
          }
        ],
        "activation": {},
        "closure": []
      },
      "expected": {
        "verdict": "Pending",
        "frontier": [
          [
            "ex:payPerUse"
          ]
        ],
        "obligations": [],
        "why": "Everything matches except the issuer: the duty's attester is ex:Bank, and ex:Alice is not below it, so ev-pay does not count (§5.3). No witness: outstanding."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "payment attested by a branch of the bank",
      "request": {
        "reference": "req-7",
        "action": "ex:downloadReport",
        "target": "ex:MarketReport",
        "at": "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z",
        "parties": {
          "odrl:assignee": "ex:Alice"
        },
        "params": {}
      },
      "sotw": {
        "effective_at": "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z",
        "facts": {},
        "evidence": [
          {
            "id": "ev-pay",
            "occurred_at": "2026-06-01T11:58:00Z",
            "actor": "ex:Alice",
            "action": "ex:pay",
            "object": "ex:ReportFee",
            "issuer": "ex:BankBranch",
            "discharges": {
              "duty": "ex:payPerUse",
              "reference": "req-7"
            }
          }
        ],
        "activation": {},
        "closure": [
          [
            "odrl:partOf",
            "ex:BankBranch",
            "ex:Bank"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "verdict": "Permit",
        "frontier": [],
        "obligations": [],
        "why": "As in scenario 1, except that ev-pay is issued by ex:BankBranch. The closure puts ex:BankBranch below ex:Bank, the duty's attester, so the evidence counts (§5.3) and witnesses req-7's instance. The candidate is ready."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "payment with no issuer",
      "request": {
        "reference": "req-7",
        "action": "ex:downloadReport",
        "target": "ex:MarketReport",
        "at": "2026-06-01T12:00:00Z",
        "parties": {
          "odrl:assignee": "ex:Alice"
        },
